ock-player-5931a55d-9249-4226-ab3f-9dc00d51e7dd-container" class="ive-alttext-container" tabindex="0" role="description" aria-label="Click to play video, • A how-to video on product usage that covers how to connect a Samsung T7 portable SSD to an iPhone 15 Pro via USB-C and organize video project files using a recommended folder structure.

• Requirements for external SSD recording include an iPhone 15 Pro or Pro Max, a drive with at least 220 MB/s sustained performance, and less than 4.5W power draw — specs the Samsung T7 meets.

• The recommended folder structure starts with a named project folder containing five subfolders: Assets, Edit Data, Exports, Documents, and Notes, with Assets further divided into Footage, Audio, and Graphics.

• Three additional workflow tips are covered: using Samsung Magician software to manage the T7, attaching a MagSafe sticker to the T7 so it magnetically connects to the phone, and using the USB-C port to connect the iPhone 15 Pro to an external display for a larger editing view."></div><video id="detailpage-imageblock-player-5931a55d-9249-4226-ab3f-9dc00d51e7dd-container-element_html5_api" class="vjs-tech" playsinline="playsinline" disablepictureinpicture="true" tabindex="-1" preload="auto" poster="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/BW_MEDIAX_AVIF_MEASUREMENT_1306696-T2/images/I/51d--Z6jF2L.jpg" src="blob:https://www.amazon.com/fbb6f9bb-e9bc-44e1-a272-e09ecba0b578"></video><div class="vjs-poster" tabindex="-1" aria-disabled="false" style="background-image: url(&quot;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/BW_MEDIAX_AVIF_MEASUREMENT_1306696-T2/images/I/51d--Z6jF2L.jpg&quot;);"></div><div class="vjs-text-track-display" aria-live="off" aria-atomic="true"><div style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; margin: 1.5%;"></div></div><div class="vjs-loading-spinner" dir="ltr"><span class="vjs-control-text">Video Player is loading.</span></div><button class="vjs-big-play-button" type="button" title="Click to play video" aria-disabled="false" tabindex="-1"><span class="vjs-icon-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="vjs-control-text" aria-live="polite">Click to play video</span></button><div class="vjs-control-bar" dir="ltr"><button class="vjs-play-control vjs-control vjs-button" type="button" title="Play" aria-disabled="false" aria-label="Play"><span class="vjs-icon-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="vjs-control-text" aria-live="polite">Play</span></button><div class="vjs-volume-panel vjs-control vjs-volume-panel-horizontal"><button class="vjs-mute-control vjs-control vjs-button vjs-vol-3" type="button" title="Mute" aria-disabled="false" aria-label="Mute"><span class="vjs-icon-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="vjs-control-text" aria-li