 positive feedback, with one customer mentioning it can sustain 500-600MB/s with long writes over 100GB, and customers like its compact size, describing it as small enough to carry in a pocket. Customers disagree on the drive's reliability and value for money, with some finding it extremely reliable while others report issues, and some consider it well worth the price while others say it's not worth the cost. Customers disagree on compatibility, with some reporting seamless laptop integration while others struggle with MacOS compatibility.<!-- k-injected k-component-close --></span><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --></div><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=SharedContent-a1xC_XJJvXZe2O_ k-id=f304030a-52af-481b-bf74-2b3e9a480432 k-data=[omitted] k-closure-key=aspectReadMoreE_320_13 k-closure-holder=9659c022-4906-4741-9c27-cde9cc871a2a k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=ExperimentalShow-m341qX1jtPsrE6B k-id=8a509dda-8976-4a99-86a3-4d5ae5488401 k-composed=ExperimentalSho_165_5 k-parent=f304030a-52af-481b-bf74-2b3e9a480432 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><div class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z" style="" k-observe="" k-use="8a509dda-8976-4a99-86a3-4d5ae5488401" k-class="condition_style_50_3" k-style="inlineStyles_51_3" k-init="" k-bound=""><div data-testid="ai-disclaimer" style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IY0d __P0nNOOvptwIJ __HcWz_SzO0"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __HcWWkUdHN __HcWNg-FAv __3LVrZoFAv">AI Generated from the text of customer reviews</span><img src="./samsung-t7_files/sfwfCa9XX12F4At.png" k-metric-loaded-enabled="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display:inline-block;height:18px;width:18px;object-fit:cover;" class="aui-primitive __P0nNOOKHIa4a __P0nNOONh5Qzh __HcWIi-bS7X-z"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" 