rge files directly from their camera, while another describes successfully consolidating files from multiple devices.</span><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z __P0nNOOKHIwIJ"><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=SnippetList-p7YoaSkonpmESLV k-id=1794d3f5-3ea1-43a6-96f6-bdb023023de2 k-composed=SnippetList_asp_100_25 k-parent=194bf1bd-908c-4376-8397-f4837183f99d k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z"><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand=snippet_36_21 k-id=276a1a93-6028-43c9-b01e-137b574c922e k-parent=1794d3f5-3ea1-43a6-96f6-bdb023023de2 k-data=[omitted] k-init--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z __P0nNOOvpt01x"><div data-csa-c-type="uxElement" data-csa-c-item-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-pos="" data-csa-c-posx="" data-csa-c-posy="" data-csa-c-owner="CustomerReviews" data-csa-c-item-type="" data-csa-c-parent-element-id="" class="aui-primitive" data-csa-c-slot-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-id="s2h7eq-dch1lb-ez6yjm-tqe3hb"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">...This drive is amazing: speed, </span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ __SARCET4AB">capacity</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">, portability, and price! I was so happy with its performance as an archive drive that I know have a second one.</span></span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitiv