</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="cr-review-media-popover-R2X4B98NBN87XT" class="aok-hidden"><div class="a-section _Y3Itd_media-popover-container_2Vf8U"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-list-container_38-H0"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-container-overlay_1nuZ1" data-hook="ReviewMediaPopover" id="review-media-popover-content-R2X4B98NBN87XT"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-content-wrapper_3MziH"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-background-wrapper_2UMSb"><div class="_Y3Itd_page-indicator-container_1X84N"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-page-indicator_10KaA" data-hook="PageIndicator"></div></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-topbar_knKqX"><button data-popover-id="R2X4B98NBN87XT" class="_Y3Itd_close-button_2RG2d" data-hook="ReviewMediaPopoverCloseButton" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverCloseButtonClickHandler" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-id="u83c9f-juuiff-36g0zm-ub9k02"><i class="a-icon a-icon-close-white a-icon-medium" role="presentation"></i></button></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-view-container_1kFg1" data-hook="ReviewMediaList"><button data-popover-id="R2X4B98NBN87XT" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-overlay_2x3M5" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverNextMediaClickHandler"></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><div data-hook="reviewContainer" data-translatable="false" data-reviewid="R18BE8USRIALFY" data-asin="B0BHZQGN26" data-mobile="false" data-locale="en-US" data-localelanguagename="English" data-sourcelanguage="en-US" data-sourcelanguagename="English" data-iscustomerrecognized="true" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="ATVPDKIKX0DER"><div id="R18BE8USRIALFY" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R18BE8USRIALFY" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="858l4e-gipnnh-sip2h9-bplyqy"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHRY2KQ7ATK6YJ6YWPM5BVQHJ5FA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R18BE8USRIALFY_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="n7dcrg-w1ljz0-shnbmb-nc1rgf"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./samsung-t7_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/BW_MEDIAX_AVIF_MEASUREMENT_1306696-T2/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/cc06b037-9352-4ceb-955c-1b9789ad15a5._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpeg"><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/BW_MEDIAX_AVIF_MEASUREMENT_1306696-T2/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/cc06b037-9352-4ceb-955c-1b9789ad15a5._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpeg"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">AOP3D tech 9 WHISTLESTOP MALL ROCKPORT MA </span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R18BE8USRIALFY/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">aop3d loves this ssd</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on November 21, 2023</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B0BHZQGN26/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: Black<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Capacity: 4 TB</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-8"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-8-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-8-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-8-card0" data-csa-c-id="58hve7-25a30r-u7vj33-lxmp2m"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Title: Exceptional Performance and Rugged Reliability - A Game-Changer for Creators!</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Rating: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>I recently purchased the Samsung T7 Shield 4TB Portable SSD, and I must say it has exceeded my expectations in every aspect. As a photographer and content creator, my workflow demands both high-speed data transfer and reliable durability, and the T7 Shield delivers on both fronts with flying colors.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>**Performance (5/5):**</span></p><p><span>The T7 Shield's lightning-fast data transfer speeds, boasting up to 1050MB/s, make file transfers a breeze. Whether I'm working with large RAW photo files or editing high-resolution videos, the T7 Shield significantly reduces wait times, allowing me to focus on the creative process rather than data transfer limitations. The USB 3.2 Gen2 interface ensures a seamless connection to my devices, and I appreciate the versatility it offers for a wide range of applications.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>**Rugged Design (5/5):**</span></p><p><span>The T7 Shield's rugged design is a standout feature. Its IP65 water and dust resistance provide peace of mind, especially when working in unpredictable environments. I've taken it on outdoor shoots, and it has withstood everything from light rain to dusty conditions without a hiccup. The sturdy aluminum exterior not only looks sleek but also adds an extra layer of durability, protecting my valuable data from unexpected bumps and drops.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>**Capacity (5/5):**</span></p><p><span>The 4TB storage capacity is a game-changer for creators dealing with large files. It accommodates my growing library of high-resolution photos and 4K videos, offering ample space for my creative projects. The fact that such a substantial amount of storage is packed into a portable form factor is a testament to Samsung's commitment to meeting the needs of professionals and enthusiasts alike.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>**Compatibility (5/5):**</span></p><p><span>The T7 Shield's compatibility with a variety of devices, including PCs, Macs, and gaming consoles, makes it a versatile solution for my multi-device workflow. I've seamlessly used it across different platforms without any compatibility issues, and the plug-and-play functionality ensures a hassle-free experience.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>**Portability (5/5):**</span></p><p><span>Weighing in at just a few ounces and boasting a compact design, the T7 Shield is the epitome of portability. It slips easily into my pocket or camera bag, allowing me to carry my work wherever I go. The included USB-C to USB-C and USB-C to USB-A cables add to the convenience, ensuring that I can connect it to a variety of devices without needing additional accessories.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>In conclusion, the Samsung T7 Shield 4TB Portable SSD is a stellar investment for photographers, content creators, and gamers alike. Its exceptional performance, rugged design, ample capacity, broad compatibility, and unmatched portability make it a must-have tool for anyone serious about their creative endeavors. Samsung has once again raised the bar in the world of portable SSDs, and the T7 Shield has become an indispensable part of my creative toolkit. Highly recommended!</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="dxj3b8-nd0yel-hqhlut-bp6pp3"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small"><div class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile-section_15c2C"><button class="_Y3Itd_single-review-thumbnail-container_9KgXc" data-mix-operations="SingleReviewMediaImageThumbnailClickHandler" data-reviewid="R18BE8USRIALFY" data-physicalid="71ZJTkEFgWL"><img alt="aop3d loves this ssd" src="./samsung-t7_files/71ZJTkEFgWL._SY500_.jpg" data-hook="review-image-tile" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile_3c5HW"></button><div id="mediaModal_R18BE8USRIALFY"><div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-cr-top-reviews-media-modal_R18BE8USRIALFY"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-header-container_1kb6I"></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-media-popover-container_FDNFG" data-hook="media-popover-container"><div class="_Y3Itd_modal-content-container_1p_Aj" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-reviewbind="SingleReviewMediaBlock" data-reviewid="R18BE8USRIALFY" data-csa-c-slot-id="cm_cr_image_popover" data-closebuttonaria="" data-modaltitlearia="" data-hook="modal-content-container" data-csa-c-id="26eppu-yvhg64-r4ee74-l0vhov"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-body-container_3kalb"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-container_39x8v"><button class="_Y3Itd_left-icon-container_1saao" data-mix-operations="leftClickHandler"><span class="_Y3Itd_cr-icon_S_3MZ"><img role="img" aria-label="" class="_Y3Itd_button-icon_1Xsqv" src="./samsung-t7_files/23pID5Mp1WTA-31.svg"></span></button><div data-reviewbind="MainMedia" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-modal-media-list-view-container_1uARM"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view-container_1XEVZ" data-mediaid="71ZJTkEFgWL" data-lazyimagesource="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/BW_MEDIAX_AVIF_MEASUREMENT_1306696-T2/images/I/71ZJTkEFgWL.jpg" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="cm_cr_image_popover_71ZJTkEFgWL_0" data-csa-c-id="hgxw9s-dua83p-hdo4qb-mipjjt"><img alt="aop3d loves this ssd" src="./samsung-t7_files/71ZJTkEFgWL._SY500_.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view_1J8fN"></div></div><button class="_Y3Itd_right-icon-container_2ryP4" data-mix-operations="rightClickHandler"><span class="_Y3Itd_cr-icon_S_3MZ"><img role="img" aria-label="" class="_Y3Itd_button-icon_1Xsqv" src="./samsung-t7_files/7D8iRtQ0DrKAF4O.svg"></span></button></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-review-container_1w2Ex"><div class="a-section _Y3Itd_cr-media-popover-sidepanel-container_2rHXZ"><div class="a-section a-spacing-small _Y3Itd_cr-media-popover-sidepanel-header-section_KhwYb"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHRY2KQ7ATK6YJ6YWPM5BVQHJ5FA" data-csa-c-slot-id="profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="2ij6jn-21rv2d-420y79-y3pxqg"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./samsung-t7_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/BW_MEDIAX_AVIF_MEASUREMENT_1306696-T2/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/cc06b037-9352-4ceb-955c-1b9789ad15a5._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpeg" style=""><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/BW_MEDIAX_AVIF_MEASUREMENT_1306696-T2/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/cc06b037-9352-4ceb-955c-1b9789ad15a5._CR0%2C0%2C500%2C500_SX460_SX48_.jpeg"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">AOP3D tech 9 WHISTLESTOP MALL ROCKPORT MA </span></div></a></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-none"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R18BE8USRIALFY/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">aop3d loves this ssd</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on November 21, 2023</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B0BHZQGN26/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: Black<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Capacity: 4 TB</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div></div><p><span>Title: Exceptional Performance and Rugged Reliability - A Game-Changer for Creators!</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Rating: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>I recently purchased the Samsung T7 Shield 4TB Portable SSD, and I must say it has exceeded my expectations in every aspect. As a photographer and content creator, my workflow demands both high-speed data transfer and reliable durability, and the T7 Shield delivers on both fronts with flying colors.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>**Performance (5/5):**</span></p><p><span>The T7 Shield's lightning-fast data transfer speeds, boasting up to 1050MB/s, make file transfers a breeze. Whether I'm working with large RAW photo files or editing high-resolution videos, the T7 Shield significantly reduces wait times, allowing me to focus on the creative process rather than data transfer limitations. The USB 3.2 Gen2 interface ensures a seamless connection to my devices, and I appreciate the versatility it offers for a wide range of applications.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>**Rugged Design (5/5):**</span></p><p><span>The T7 Shield's rugged design is a standout feature. Its IP65 water and dust resistance provide peace of mind, especially when working in unpredictable environments. I've taken it on outdoor shoots, and it has withstood everything from light rain to dusty conditions without a hiccup. The sturdy aluminum exterior not only looks sleek but also adds an extra layer of durability, protecting my valuable data from unexpected bumps and drops.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>**Capacity (5/5):**</span></p><p><span>The 4TB storage capacity is a game-changer for creators dealing with large files. It accommodates my growing library of high-resolution photos and 4K videos, offering ample space for my creative projects. The fact that such a substantial amount of storage is packed into a portable form factor is a testament to Samsung's commitment to meeting the needs of professionals and enthusiasts alike.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>**Compatibility (5/5):**</span></p><p><span>The T7 Shield's compatibility with a variety of devices, including PCs, Macs, and gaming consoles, makes it a versatile solution for my multi-device workflow. I've seamlessly used it across different platforms without any compatibility issues, and the plug-and-play functionality ensures a hassle-free experience.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>**Portability (5/5):**</span></p><p><span>Weighing in at just a few ounces and boasting a compact design, the T7 Shield is the epitome of portability. It slips easily into my pocket or camera bag, allowing me to carry my work wherever I go. The included USB-C to USB-C and USB-C to USB-A cables add to the convenience, ensuring that I can connect it to a variety of devices without needing additional accessories.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>In conclusion, the Samsung T7 Shield 4TB Portable SSD is a stellar investment for photographers, content creators, and gamers alike. Its exceptional performance, rugged design, ample capacity, broad compatibility, and unmatched portability make it a must-have tool for anyone serious about their creative endeavors. Samsung has once again raised the bar in the world of portable SSDs, and the T7 Shield has become an indispensable part of my creative toolkit. Highly recommended!</span></p><ul class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-container_2nWBS" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnailsBlock"><li class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-list-item-style_d1lj6" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnail"><button data-mediaid="71ZJTkEFgWL" data-reviewid="R18BE8USRIALFY" data-thumbidx="0" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-button_2LRc_" data-mix-operations="thumbnailClickHandler" aria-pressed="false"><img alt="" src="./samsung-t7_files/71ZJTkEFgWL.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-view_2J_oP" height="80" width="80"></button></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">93 people found this helpful</span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="B0BHZQGN26" data-id="R18BE8USRIALFY" data-return-to="DpReview" d