sin="B09VLHR4JC" data-mobile="false" data-locale="en-US" data-localelanguagename="English" data-sourcelanguage="en-US" data-sourcelanguagename="English" data-iscustomerrecognized="true" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="ATVPDKIKX0DER"><div id="R1IFQKQT269I06" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R1IFQKQT269I06" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="d2dqvn-nep76j-dk1twv-ea8dzt"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG43KMCYNJSMQ6OKIRSVTLKLRGQQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R1IFQKQT269I06_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="ibylpk-68z7bt-7r1c66-ak98o2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./samsung-t7_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">ilike2fly</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1IFQKQT269I06/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">Small pocket size SSD. Looks tough, but I haven't dropped it (yet)</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on October 25, 2025</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B09VLHR4JC/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: Black<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Capacity: 2 TB</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-9"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-9-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-9-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-9-card0" data-csa-c-id="oui4qr-jbygjj-cquqf3-2dynu5"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>I've had this Samsung 2TB solid state drive for two weeks and so far I like it. I'll update this review after I've used it longer. I'm using this SSD with my HP laptop and my iPhone 16 for my daily work with video files and haven't had any problems. I purchased it for $184, which is a lot more than an 2TB old-fashioned spinning drive, but worth it if it delivers on all those solid state promises of being more rugged and lasting longer.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Arrival: It arrived properly packaged and formatted and ready to use. I just plugged it in and it worked! Came with two 18 inch cables (USB-C to USB-A and USB-C to USB-C).</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Form factor: It's smaller than expected and light at 3.5 x 2.25 inches and only 1/2 inch thick (see pics). It's easy to transport in my pocket... even my front shirt pocket (just don't bend over or you'll be testing it's ruggedness). It has a rubber sleeve around it which should provide better protection when dropped (which I do a lot). It looks and feels rugged, but time will tell.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Why did I buy it: Until now I have always used a spinning external hard disk drives and I've have had a few of them fail. I'm trying this solid state drive to see if it lasts longer. I'm pretty rough on external drives, using them daily, traveling with them, throwing them in my suitcase, dropping them, etc. If this works out I may use solid state drives for my daily use and use the old-timey spinning disks only for long-term storage (the digital equivalent of putting grandpa in a comfy chair by the fire). I've used Western Digital spinning hard disk drives until now and they have been... let’s just say, loyal until they weren’t. But hey — maybe it’s not them. Maybe it’s me. ...(or maybe it's Maybelline).</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="g81z53-x7ax6s-66qw1s-8dfiyp"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small"><div class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile-section_15c2C"><button class="_Y3Itd_single-review-thumbnail-container_9KgXc" data-mix-operations="SingleReviewMediaImageThumbnailClickHandler" data-reviewid="R1IFQKQT269I06" data-physicalid="61NEcojfe5L"><img alt="Small pocket size SSD. Looks tough, but I haven&#39;t dropped it (yet)" src="./samsung-t7_files/61NEcojfe5L._SY500_.jpg" data-hook="review-image-tile" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile_3c5HW"></button><button class="_Y3Itd_single-review-thumbnail-container_9KgXc" data-mix-operations="SingleReviewMediaImageThumbnailClickHandler" data-reviewid="R1IFQKQT269I06" data-physicalid="41ojxM8gLTL"><img alt="Small pocket size SSD. Looks tough, but I haven&#39;t dropped it (yet)" src="./samsung-t7_files/41ojxM8gLTL._SY500_.jpg" data-hook="review-image-tile" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-image-tile_3c5HW"></button><div id="mediaModal_R1IFQKQT269I06"><div class="a-popover-preload" id="a-popover-cr-top-reviews-media-modal_R1IFQKQT269I06"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-header-container_1kb6I"></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-media-popover-container_FDNFG" data-hook="media-popover-container"><div class="_Y3Itd_modal-content-container_1p_Aj" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-reviewbind="SingleReviewMediaBlock" data-reviewid="R1IFQKQT269I06" data-csa-c-slot-id="cm_cr_image_popover" data-closebuttonaria="" data-modaltitlearia="" data-hook="modal-content-container" data-csa-c-id="brcqji-bsscvh-f6hog0-dilzc5"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-body-container_3kalb"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-container_39x8v"><button class="_Y3Itd_left-icon-container_1saao" data-mix-operations="leftClickHandler"><span class="_Y3Itd_cr-icon_S_3MZ"><img role="img" aria-label="" class="_Y3Itd_button-icon_1Xsqv" src="./samsung-t7_files/23pID5Mp1WTA-31.svg"></span></button><div data-reviewbind="MainMedia" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-modal-media-list-view-container_1uARM"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view-container_1XEVZ" data-mediaid="61NEcojfe5L" data-lazyimagesource="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/BW_MEDIAX_AVIF_MEASUREMENT_1306696-T2/images/I/61NEcojfe5L.jpg" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="cm_cr_image_popover_61NEcojfe5L_0" data-csa-c-id="rounpt-ofncp0-5q9595-8al14s"><img alt="Small pocket size SSD. Looks tough, but I haven&#39;t dropped it (yet)" src="./samsung-t7_files/61NEcojfe5L._SY500_.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view_1J8fN"></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view-container_1XEVZ" data-mediaid="41ojxM8gLTL" data-lazyimagesource="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/W/BW_MEDIAX_AVIF_MEASUREMENT_1306696-T2/images/I/41ojxM8gLTL.jpg" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="cm_cr_image_popover_41ojxM8gLTL_1" data-csa-c-id="ex4vcq-cqsjla-jqt6s8-voi8e6"><img alt="Small pocket size SSD. Looks tough, but I haven&#39;t dropped it (yet)" src="./samsung-t7_files/41ojxM8gLTL._SY500_.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-image-view_1J8fN"></div></div><button class="_Y3Itd_right-icon-container_2ryP4" data-mix-operations="rightClickHandler"><span class="_Y3Itd_cr-icon_S_3MZ"><img role="img" aria-label="" class="_Y3Itd_button-icon_1Xsqv" src="./samsung-t7_files/7D8iRtQ0DrKAF4O.svg"></span></button></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-review-container_1w2Ex"><div class="a-section _Y3Itd_cr-media-popover-sidepanel-container_2rHXZ"><div class="a-section a-spacing-small _Y3Itd_cr-media-popover-sidepanel-header-section_KhwYb"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AG43KMCYNJSMQ6OKIRSVTLKLRGQQ" data-csa-c-slot-id="profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="2gq80z-251eno-z6det0-iukh8c"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./samsung-t7_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png" style=""><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">ilike2fly</span></div></a></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-none"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R1IFQKQT269I06/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">Small pocket size SSD. Looks tough, but I haven't dropped it (yet)</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on October 25, 2025</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B09VLHR4JC/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: Black<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Capacity: 2 TB</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div></div><p><span>I've had this Samsung 2TB solid state drive for two weeks and so far I like it. I'll update this review after I've used it longer. I'm using this SSD with my HP laptop and my iPhone 16 for my daily work with video files and haven't had any problems. I purchased it for $184, which is a lot more than an 2TB old-fashioned spinning drive, but worth it if it delivers on all those solid state promises of being more rugged and lasting longer.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Arrival: It arrived properly packaged and formatted and ready to use. I just plugged it in and it worked! Came with two 18 inch cables (USB-C to USB-A and USB-C to USB-C).</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Form factor: It's smaller than expected and light at 3.5 x 2.25 inches and only 1/2 inch thick (see pics). It's easy to transport in my pocket... even my front shirt pocket (just don't bend over or you'll be testing it's ruggedness). It has a rubber sleeve around it which should provide better protection when dropped (which I do a lot). It looks and feels rugged, but time will tell.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Why did I buy it: Until now I have always used a spinning external hard disk drives and I've have had a few of them fail. I'm trying this solid state drive to see if it lasts longer. I'm pretty rough on external drives, using them daily, traveling with them, throwing them in my suitcase, dropping them, etc. If this works out I may use solid state drives for my daily use and use the old-timey spinning disks only for long-term storage (the digital equivalent of putting grandpa in a comfy chair by the fire). I've used Western Digital spinning hard disk drives until now and they have been... let’s just say, loyal until they weren’t. But hey — maybe it’s not them. Maybe it’s me. ...(or maybe it's Maybelline).</span></p><ul class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-container_2nWBS" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnailsBlock"><li class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-list-item-style_d1lj6" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnail"><button data-mediaid="61NEcojfe5L" data-reviewid="R1IFQKQT269I06" data-thumbidx="0" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-button_2LRc_" data-mix-operations="thumbnailClickHandler" aria-pressed="false"><img alt="" src="./samsung-t7_files/61NEcojfe5L.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-view_2J_oP" height="80" width="80"></button></li><li class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-list-item-style_d1lj6" data-reviewbind="MediaThumbnail"><button data-mediaid="41ojxM8gLTL" data-reviewid="R1IFQKQT269I06" data-thumbidx="1" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-button_2LRc_" data-mix-operations="thumbnailClickHandler" aria-pressed="false"><img alt="" src="./samsung-t7_files/41ojxM8gLTL.jpg" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-thumbnail-image-view_2J_oP" height="80" width="80"></button></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertia